        whereToFind: "The fees or services clause of your contract, and the invoice line called management, service, hosting or O&M (operations and maintenance). If it is charged in dollars rather than as a percentage, convert it first — see the mistakes section below. Some contracts have no separate fee at all and bury it in the rate; in that case put 0%.",
